Autofill's address bubbles find the tab's AutofillBubbleHandler through its Browser (the handler is the
Browser window's unowned user data, as the save-card bubble already looks it up), so they reach ArdiaCore's
handler: BrowserWindow::FindBrowserWindowWithWebContents finds BrowserViews only. A tab with no window, or a
handler that shows nothing, gets no bubble instead of a null dereference; the save-card bubble likewise.
Includes CEF's chrome_autofill_bubble_3796, folded in when CEF left the tree.
